OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian, 45, dies after being
OL,4,Astruck by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 45-year-old woman has died after she
OL,7,Fwas struck by a car in Airdrie.
OL,9,FPolice Scotland were called to reports
OL,10,Fof a crash involving a blue Audi A3 and
OL,11,Fa pedestrian on Varnsdorf Way, at about
OL,12,F18:35 on Tuesday.
OL,14,FEmergency services attended but the
OL,15,Fwoman, who has not been named, was
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FThe 23-year-old male driver was
OL,19,Farrested in connection with a road
OL,20,Ftraffic offence and later released
OL,21,Fpending further inquires.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
